### BidCraft API Requests
### Use REST Client extension in VS Code to run these

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@token = 

### ============================================
### 1. AUTH - Login
### ============================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@bidcraft.dev",
  "password": "demo1234"
}

### After login, copy the token and set @token variable above

### ============================================
### 2. AUTH - Get current user
### ============================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 3. AUCTIONS - List all auctions
### ============================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/auctions

### ============================================
### 4. AUCTIONS - List active auctions only
### ============================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/auctions?status=active

### ============================================
### 5. AUCTIONS - List finished auctions
### ============================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/auctions?status=finished

### ============================================
### 6. AUCTIONS - Create new auction
### ============================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/auctions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Digital Art Piece #001",
  "description": "A beautiful digital artwork created with modern techniques",
  "image_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1579783902614-e3fb66017edd?w=500",
  "base_price_cents": 50000,
  "min_increment_cents": 1000,
  "starts_in_seconds": 0,
  "duration_seconds": 3600
}

### ============================================
### 7. AUCTIONS - Get auction by ID
### ============================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/auctions/AUCTION_ID_HERE

### ============================================
### 8. AUCTIONS - Get auction bids history
### ============================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/auctions/AUCTION_ID_HERE/bids

### ============================================
### 9. BIDS - Place a bid
### ============================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/auctions/AUCTION_ID_HERE/bids
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount_cents": 75000
}

### ============================================
### 10. AUTH - Login as different user (bob)
### ============================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bob@bidcraft.dev",
  "password": "demo1234"
}

### ============================================
### 11. AUTH - Login as different user (carol)
### ============================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carol@bidcraft.dev",
  "password": "demo1234"
}

### ============================================
### NOTES:
### - Install "REST Client" extension in VS Code by Huachao Mao
### - Click "Send Request" above each request to execute
### - Responses appear in a side panel
### - For endpoints needing AUCTION_ID, replace with actual ID from list response
### - For @token variable, run login first, then copy the "token" from response
### ============================================
